    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapy doesn't change the fact that nothing is actually real anymore. everyone is just interacting with a shadow. it feels like i'm living in a world where i've already been erased, and i'm just stuck in this weird waiting room between being someone and being nothing. it would be so much easier if the physical part actually matched the feeling. if i could just... stop the charade.",
